# Copy the root .env.example — this file documents server-only variants:
# PORT differs from the legacy backends (4001-4007) -> the new monolith owns 4000.
#
# Supabase keys: SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY (legacy backends call it SUPABASE_KEY) and
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY are both required. JWT_SECRET must be >= 32 chars.